<title>AUSTRALIA: Cricket-Pakistan v Tasmania scoreboard.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Pakistan v Tasmania scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>LAUNCESTON 1996-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the limited-overs tour match between Pakistan and Tasmania at the Northern Tasmania Cricket Association Ground on Sunday.</p>
