<p>Bowling: Mohammad Zahid 4-0-48-0 (w-1 nb-8), Shahid Nazir 4-0-20-0, Wasim Akram 10-0-45-1 (nb-2), Saqlain Mushtaq 10-0-45-1 (w-1), Shahid Afridi 10-1-33-1, Mushtaq Ahmed 10-1-24-2 (w-2), Ijaz Ahmed Junior 2-0-16-0.</p>
